<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Outback cut near-term.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Outback cut near-term.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch has cut its near-term rating on Outback Steakhouse Inc to neutral from accumulate, the brokerage firm said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Peter Oakes, who was unavailable for comment, also maintained his long-term accumulate rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the Tampa, Fla.-based restaurant chain closed at 23-5/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
